## Key Implementation Details

✅ **Merge-Safe**: The backend uses the existing merge-safe pattern - it loads the stored chat first, merges message lists, then updates the seen_by field  
✅ **Conflict Resolution**: If the message was modified by others, existing seen_by entries are preserved and the new username is appended  
✅ **Idempotent**: Calling mark-seen multiple times with the same username won't create duplicates  
✅ **Frontend Sync**: The frontend updates the local message.seen_by list immediately after successful API call

